### GET all
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books

### GET all filtered by genre
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books?genre=Dystopian

### GET one
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/1

### GET one (not found, expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/999

### POST (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kindred",
  "author": "Octavia Butler",
  "year": 1979,
  "genre": "Science Fiction"
}

### POST invalid (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### PUT (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Things Fall Apart (Updated)",
  "author": "Chinua Achebe",
  "year": 1958,
  "genre": "Classic"
}

### DELETE (expect 200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/books/2
